// @note: Nothing in interp/check/l1 depends on mycelium-std-io, and L1 has NO import/module
// @note: construct at all beyond the atomic @std-sys marker that gates `wild`. There is no `use std.io;`.
// @note: Observed: "unknown function/constructor/prim to_json" — the same error a made-up identifier gives.
// @note: CONSEQUENCE: all 26 pure mycelium-std-* crates are unreachable from Mycelium source; the only
